+
+## Amendment: optional Battery Status API (#1790)
+
+The explicit platform catalog includes battery-status and BatteryManager. The
+existing generator owns its native promise, getters, EventTarget inheritance
+and typed event names. Consumers feature-check Navigator::get_battery before
+calling it, since support is optional. No application-local binding is needed.
+This is case N of ADR 0262: native JavaScript behavior is preserved unchanged.
+The webapi-battery regression checks promises, rejection identity, getters and
+listener identity/removal.
